  ],
  "description": "Same command as CCM but for the the sequence sequencename . Only selected images in the sequence are processed.\n\nThe output sequence name starts with the prefix \"ccm\" unless otherwise specified with option -prefix=\n\nLinks: ccm\n\nUses fixed input references and writes only invocation-owned outputs. Optional argument values are sent only when their use_* control is true; zero is preserved.",
